   "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the update <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/suga\">@Suga</a> and <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/tamara\">@Tamara</a></p>\n<p>Only 2 more boxes to check and it’s time to HATCH!</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/13eb5cc592735a81242711cfcacf4cecb42f7e43\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/13eb5cc592735a81242711cfcacf4cecb42f7e43.jpeg\" title=\"IMG_2789\"><img alt=\"IMG_2789\" data-base62-sha1=\"2QdkG6dzdSPdjprXrp2ycO2n08H\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/13eb5cc592735a81242711cfcacf4cecb42f7e43_2_10x10.png\" height=\"460\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/13eb5cc592735a81242711cfcacf4cecb42f7e43_2_690x460.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/13eb5cc592735a81242711cfcacf4cecb42f7e43_2_690x460.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/13eb5cc592735a81242711cfcacf4cecb42f7e43_2_1035x690.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/13eb5cc592735a81242711cfcacf4cecb42f7e43_2_1380x920.jpeg 2x\" width=\"690\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">IMG_2789</span><span class=\"informations\">2478×1652 464 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>",
